@gateway = https://localhost:5291
@clientToken = REPLACE_LOCALLY
@artistToken = REPLACE_LOCALLY
@artistId = REPLACE_UUID
@engagementId = REPLACE_UUID
@proposalId = REPLACE_UUID
@conversationId = REPLACE_UUID
@reservationId = REPLACE_UUID
@entryId = REPLACE_UUID
@reservationDate = 2030-01-15
@start = 2030-01-15T10:00:00-03:00
@end = 2030-01-15T11:00:00-03:00
@effectiveDate = 2026-11-03
@requestKey = REPLACE_NEW_UUID
@from = 2026-11-03
@to = 2026-11-04

### Catálogo público
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/artists/suggestions?term=blakwork

### Perfil privado
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/profiles/me
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### Pedido; repetir a mesma chave e corpo recupera o resultado
POST {{gateway}}/api/v2/engagements
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{requestKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"artistId":"{{artistId}}","idea":"Tatuagem floral","bodyRegion":"Braço","approximateSizeCm":10}

### Proposta exige outra chave UUID
POST {{gateway}}/api/v2/engagements/{{engagementId}}/proposals
Authorization: Bearer {{artistToken}}
Idempotency-Key: REPLACE_ANOTHER_UUID
Content-Type: application/json

{"description":"Sessão floral","amount":450}

### Aceite não cria recebimento ou horário
PUT {{gateway}}/api/v2/engagements/{{engagementId}}/proposals/{{proposalId}}/acceptance
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### Histórico autorizado
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### Erro 400: mensagem vazia
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Idempotency-Key: REPLACE_ANOTHER_UUID
Content-Type: application/json

{"body":" "}

### Encerramento: 202 é pendência; reservas futuras impedem conclusão
POST {{gateway}}/api/v2/engagements/{{engagementId}}/closure
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"confirmed":true}

### Acompanhar processo
GET {{gateway}}/api/v2/engagements/{{engagementId}}/lifecycle
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### Dashboard do artista
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/finance/dashboard?from={{from}}&to={{to}}
Authorization: Bearer {{artistToken}}

### Erro 401, sem autenticação
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/finance/dashboard?from={{from}}&to={{to}}

### Publicar perfil pelo artista
PUT {{gateway}}/api/v1/artists/me
Authorization: Bearer {{artistToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Artista de exemplo","studio":"Estúdio","city":"São Paulo","biography":"Portfólio","styles":["Blackwork"],"startingPrice":300}

### Salvar favorito próprio
PUT {{gateway}}/api/v1/favorites/{{artistId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### Disponibilidade: ajustar a data e os horários ao cenário real
PUT {{gateway}}/api/v1/scheduling/availability/{{reservationDate}}
Authorization: Bearer {{artistToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"timeZoneId":"America/Sao_Paulo","windows":[{"start":"10:00:00","end":"12:00:00"}]}

### Reserva exige proposta aceita e intervalo futuro dentro da disponibilidade
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/scheduling/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{artistToken}}
Idempotency-Key: REPLACE_ANOTHER_UUID
Content-Type: application/json

{"engagementId":"{{engagementId}}","start":"{{start}}","end":"{{end}}"}

### Conclusão: somente após o término real; antes dele, esperar 400
PUT {{gateway}}/api/v1/scheduling/reservations/{{reservationId}}/completion
Authorization: Bearer {{artistToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"completedAt":"{{end}}","amount":450}

### Recebimento manual: ajustar effectiveDate para não ser futura
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/finance/entries
Authorization: Bearer {{artistToken}}
Idempotency-Key: REPLACE_ANOTHER_UUID
Content-Type: application/json

{"kind":"Receipt","description":"Parcela recebida","amount":4000,"effectiveDate":"{{effectiveDate}}","engagementId":"{{engagementId}}"}

### Custo geral: usar chave própria
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/finance/entries
Authorization: Bearer {{artistToken}}
Idempotency-Key: REPLACE_ANOTHER_UUID
Content-Type: application/json

{"kind":"Cost","description":"Material","amount":940,"effectiveDate":"{{effectiveDate}}"}

### Estorno integral único: preserva original e sua data efetiva
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/finance/entries/{{entryId}}/reversal
Authorization: Bearer {{artistToken}}
Idempotency-Key: REPLACE_ANOTHER_UUID
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"Correção gerencial"}
